Oh, don't even think about it, dude.

362
00:23:20.116 --> 00:23:22.699
All my life I sat in your car.

363
00:23:23.991 --> 00:23:25.490
Now it's my turn.

364
00:23:28.075 --> 00:23:29.949
What are you doing?

365
00:23:29.950 --> 00:23:32.449
12,000 Euro. She rides first class.

366
