1226
01:21:09.033 --> 01:21:11.740
Natasha, stay for a few more days.

1227
01:21:11.950 --> 01:21:13.032
You don't mean that.

1228
01:21:13.283 --> 01:21:14.574
No, I do.

1229
01:21:14.700 --> 01:21:16.449
I don't like it that you're so sad.

1230
01:21:16.950 --> 01:21:18.365
