You live with it

1272
01:24:19.575 --> 01:24:21.657
I'm aware of it

1273
01:24:22.200 --> 01:24:24.199
Out in the open for the world to see

1274
01:24:24.283 --> 01:24:26.574
What is this unknown mystery?

1275
01:25:55.033 --> 01:25:56.199
Who is it?

1276
01:26:11.658 --> 01:26:12.657
Laila?

1277
